@baseUrl = {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/api
@parentToken = demo_parent_token
@studentToken = demo_student_token

### Learners of the parent account (Bạn, Bin, Su) + default + fees due this week
GET {{baseUrl}}/today/learners?api_token={{parentToken}}

### Today for the default learner
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?api_token={{parentToken}}

### Today for one learner (replace the id with one from /today/learners)
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?learnerId=1&api_token={{parentToken}}

### Student with no kids: only "Bạn"
GET {{baseUrl}}/today/learners?api_token={{studentToken}}

### Student today
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?api_token={{studentToken}}

### Another account's learner is rejected (expect resultCode 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/today?learnerId=5&api_token={{parentToken}}

### Mark attendance ("Bé đã đi học") - only after the session started
POST {{baseUrl}}/today/attendance?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "sessionKey": "1_20261013" }

### Join online class - opens 15 minutes before start, returns the Zoom link
POST {{baseUrl}}/today/join?api_token={{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "sessionKey": "1_20261013" }

### Ask for leave / reschedule / makeup (type: leave | reschedule | makeup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/today/requests?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "sessionKey": "1_20261016", "type": "leave", "note": "Bé ốm" }

### Fee period guard: overlapping period is rejected, next period is accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/add?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": 1, "studentId": 1, "startDate": "2026-12-01" }

### Plan 07: surveys waiting for this account (mid-course "Bé học có vui không?")
GET {{baseUrl}}/lifecycle/surveys?api_token={{parentToken}}

### Plan 07: answer a survey (score 1-5, note optional; low scores notify the back office)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lifecycle/feedback?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enrollmentId": 1, "score": 4, "note": "" }

### Plan 07: one-tap renewal (puts the same course, learner and class in the cart; then POST /checkout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lifecycle/renew?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enrollmentId": 1 }

### Plan 07 test flow with the demo seed (scripts/seed_today_demo.sql)
# 1. Run the seed, 2. run the scan below, 3. check the parent's notifications (second request):
POST {{$dotenv BE_BASE_URL}}/admin/lifecycle/run?api_token={{$dotenv ADMIN_TOKEN}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/notification?api_token={{parentToken}}
# Expect: lifecycle_start for Bin (tomorrow, guitar) and Su (3 days, chess), lifecycle_absent for Su (maths),
# lifecycle_survey for Bin (English), schedule_renewal (renew + fee steps, sent by the 5-minute dispatch, run the endpoint twice).
# 4. Renew Bin's Kỹ năng sống (find its enrollment id in /today -> packages[].enrollmentId), then POST /checkout and pay the order:
#    the early bonus (50 anyPoint) shows in wallet history as "Thưởng gia hạn sớm".

### Plan 08: the suggestion card of /today for a learner (replace learnerId with Bin's id from /today/learners)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?context=today&learnerId=1&api_token={{parentToken}}

### Plan 08: suggestions for the siblings after an order (order id printed by the seed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?context=order_success&orderId=1&api_token={{parentToken}}

### Plan 08: a suggestion was shown / clicked (source: pathway, sibling, free_slot, season, interest)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/events?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "itemId": 1, "source": "pathway", "context": "today", "event": "click" }

### Plan 08: "Không quan tâm" hides the course for this learner (default 30 days, back office setting)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/dismiss?api_token={{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "learnerId": 1, "itemId": 1 }

### Plan 08: pathways seen by visitors; with learnerId the progress ("2/3 bước")
GET {{baseUrl}}/pathways/demo-tieng-anh?learnerId=1&api_token={{parentToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/1/pathway?learnerId=1&api_token={{parentToken}}
